Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 02:09:20 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1132/1265] The Engine page left from the bar; unsaved GPU
 roles asked first (1166, part twelve)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Viktor 04.10.2026: «Когда страничка Engine выведена в фокус, единственная возможность уйти с неё,
либо кнопка `Назад к сочинению`, либо F5. Добавь кликание по бару Студии, и гашение попапа
странички. Также, если в GPU что-то изменил, но не сохранил, требовать в попап диалоге действие -
сохранить/игнорировать».

- Every way out of the Engine page goes through leaveEngine(): a room in the bar (that room
  opens), the logo, Back to composing, Esc, the Engine button itself.
- GPU roles changed and not saved: a dialog that only its two buttons answer (HeresyDialog's new
  must: Esc and a click beside it do nothing): Save (the page goes only when the lab took it) or
  Ignore (the boxes back as the lab keeps them, at once: HeresyGpus.reset, then read afresh).
- The dialog's words in the six catalogs (2,435 keys each).

Checked headless in Russian, the lab's GPU roles never written (the test blocked every POST): a
room tab leaves a clean page at once; with one box turned over, a room tab, the logo and Esc each
bring the dialog, Esc and a click beside it leave it standing, Ignore leaves the page and puts the
boxes back. cdp-console 317/0/7, check-i18n 14/0, check-player 3/0.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
